Z||000000||wayne||05-26-2000||06:48 AM||||The Haynes manual says to use 5W30 Motor Oil in a  manual tranaxle. Is this correct?<P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||bHooper||05-26-2000||07:16 AM||||this is the correct lubricant for the Getrag Muncie 5 spd.  i do not know about the other tranny's.<P>hope this helps.<P>hoop||||reg||1
