Z||000003||Cooter||05-26-2000||09:59 AM||||I used Mobil 0w30 in my Isuzu tranny. It seemed to be a little easier to shift afterwards- but that could have been the 85w90 gear oil that the previous owner put in causing the poor shifting.||||reg||1
